  "instructions": [
    "Slice the pork into strips and marinate it with egg, soy sauce, and part of the cornstarch.",
    "Mix the remaining cornstarch with water and vinegar to make a slurry.",
    "Fry the marinated pork in hot oil until browned and cooked through, then drain it.",
